        "Title": "Note description\nScript Name: Replace part of room number\nCategory: Write to Revit\nAuthor: CatBuilds\nDate: 21.09.2026\nVersion: 1.0\nDescription:\nThis script scans all rooms in the active Revit project and identifies any rooms with a specific p\narameter, BuikdingID. In this case we look at rooms with value B2. However it scans for room numbers containing \"01.ST\" and replace the \"01\" with \"02\".",
